#: src/ui.rs:128
msgid ""
"EPS only, voice-centric: the phone uses only the 4G/5G network and puts "
"calls first: where VoLTE is missing, it is not content with data alone. On a "
"network without 2G/3G this does not help; the usual choice there is the next "
"one."
msgstr ""
"仅 EPS，面向语音：手机只使用 4G/5G 网络，并且以通话为先：没有 VoLTE 时，它不"
"会安心只用数据。在没有 2G/3G 的网络上这项没有用，那种情况通常选下一项。"

#: src/ui.rs:130
msgid ""
"EPS only, data-centric: the phone uses only the 4G/5G network and puts data "
"first. It stays registered on a carrier that has no 2G/3G network for this "
"phone, such as China Telecom. Calls then need VoLTE: without it, no calls "
"are possible."
msgstr ""
"仅 EPS，面向数据：手机只使用 4G/5G 网络，并且以数据为先。在没有 2G/3G 网络的"
"运营商（比如中国电信）上能保持注册、不再掉线。代价是通话要靠 VoLTE：没有 "
"VoLTE 就打不了电话。"

#: src/ui.rs:132
msgid ""
"EPS and non-EPS, voice-centric: the phone uses 4G/5G and also the old 2G/3G "
"network for calls and SMS, and puts calls first. This is the modem's own "
"default. It is right where the carrier has a 2G/3G network. Where it has "
"none, as with China Telecom, the registration drops every few minutes: the "
"network refuses with “CS domain not available”."
msgstr ""
"EPS 与非 EPS，面向语音：手机用 4G/5G，同时用老的 2G/3G 网络来打电话和收发短"
"信，以通话为先。这是基带自带的默认值。运营商有 2G/3G 网络时选它；没有的话（比"
"如中国电信）注册会每几分钟掉一次，网络拒绝的原因是「CS domain not "
"available」。"

#: src/ui.rs:134
msgid ""
"EPS and non-EPS, data-centric: the phone uses 4G/5G and the old 2G/3G "
"network, and puts data first. Right where the carrier has a 2G/3G network "
"and data matters more than calls. Where it has none, the registration drops "
"every few minutes, as with the previous one."
msgstr ""
"EPS 与非 EPS，面向数据：手机用 4G/5G 和老的 2G/3G 网络，以数据为先。运营商有 "
"2G/3G 网络、而你更看重数据时选它。没有 2G/3G 的话，注册同样会每几分钟掉一次。"

#: src/ui.rs:143
msgid "EPS: the 4G and 5G network. Everything on it is data."
msgstr "EPS：4G 和 5G 网络，上面传的都是数据。"

#: src/ui.rs:144
msgid ""
"Non-EPS, or the circuit-switched (CS) domain: the older 2G and 3G network, "
"made for calls and SMS."
msgstr ""
"非 EPS，也就是电路域（CS）：老的 2G 和 3G 网络，是为打电话和收发短信建的。"

#: src/ui.rs:146
msgid ""
"PS only: the phone asks for data service only, so it registers on 4G/5G "
"alone."
msgstr "仅 PS：手机只请求数据业务，所以只在 4G/5G 上注册。"

#: src/ui.rs:147
msgid ""
"CS and PS: the phone asks for calls and SMS as well, so it also registers on "
"2G/3G."
msgstr "CS 和 PS：手机同时请求通话和短信业务，所以也在 2G/3G 上注册。"

#: src/ui.rs:148
msgid ""
"Voice-centric: calls come first. The phone wants a network on which it can "
"call."
msgstr "面向语音：通话优先。手机想要一个能打电话的网络。"

#: src/ui.rs:149
msgid ""
"Data-centric: data comes first. The phone stays on 4G/5G even where it could "
"not call."
msgstr "面向数据：数据优先。即使在打不了电话的地方，手机也留在 4G/5G 上。"

#: src/ui.rs:151
msgid "VoLTE: calls over the 4G/5G network, with no 2G/3G network behind them."
msgstr "VoLTE：通过 4G/5G 网络打电话，后面不需要 2G/3G 网络。"

